service.share.email.body:
Suppose you're thinking about a new website. Suddenly someone'll say 'how about a Notion-powered CMS for free' out of the blue, no explanation. No point in looking for one, either. It's all part of a cosmic unconsciousness.

{site}. A GitHub repo template where all website copy and blog posts can be managed in Notion. It's a free template under the MIT licence, and it deploys on Vercel in five steps.

{url}

